From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wasm64 port <wasm64@localhost>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 01:48:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wasm64 port: drop the Batteries umbrella import; Mathlib v4.35.0 names
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Game/Metadata.lean: drop `import Batteries`. The release's Mathlib packs
  have no `Batteries.olean` umbrella; the Batteries modules Robo uses arrive
  through `Mathlib.Tactic.Common`, which Game/Metadata/FromMathlib.lean
  imports.
- Game/Metadata/FromMathlib.lean: `import Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic` ->
  `import Mathlib.Basic.Real.Basic` (Mathlib v4.34.0 keeps the old name only
  as a deprecated_module shim for this module, which would warn).
- Game/Metadata/FromMathlib.lean (Lean 4.35): `Mathlib.Data.Int.SuccPred`
  -> `Mathlib.Order.SuccPred.Int`, `Mathlib.Data.Int.Star` ->
  `Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Star.Int`, `Mathlib.Data.Rat.Star` ->
  `Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Star.Rat`: Mathlib v4.35.0 keeps each old name only
  as a deprecated_module shim that is exactly `public import` of the new
  one, and the compile printed one deprecation warning per shim. Same
  environment.

Everything else Robo needs beyond the essential pack
(Mathlib.Tactic.{Have,Cases,Generalize}, Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Ring.Star,
Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Star.{Int,Rat}) is in the toolchain release's
mathlib-game-extra pack under its real module name.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Game/Metadata.lean             | 3 ++-
 Game/Metadata/FromMathlib.lean | 8 ++++----
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Game/Metadata.lean b/Game/Metadata.lean
index 22fd996..28a7568 100644
--- a/Game/Metadata.lean
+++ b/Game/Metadata.lean
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
-import Batteries
+-- wasm64 port: the `Batteries` umbrella module is not in the essential pack
+-- (its contents arrive through `Mathlib.Tactic.Common` below).
 import GameServer
 import Game.Doc
 
diff --git a/Game/Metadata/FromMathlib.lean b/Game/Metadata/FromMathlib.lean
index 49dc228..8020d0d 100644
--- a/Game/Metadata/FromMathlib.lean
+++ b/Game/Metadata/FromMathlib.lean
@@ -28,10 +28,10 @@ import Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Ring.Star
 --import Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Ring.Star
 import Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Rat
 import Mathlib.Data.Fin.VecNotation
-import Mathlib.Data.Int.SuccPred
-import Mathlib.Data.Int.Star
+import Mathlib.Order.SuccPred.Int  -- wasm64 port: Mathlib v4.35.0 keeps Mathlib.Data.Int.SuccPred only as a deprecated shim for this module
+import Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Star.Int  -- wasm64 port: Mathlib v4.35.0 keeps Mathlib.Data.Int.Star only as a deprecated shim for this module
 --import Mathlib.Data.Int.Star
 import Mathlib.Data.Nat.Prime.Defs
-import Mathlib.Data.Rat.Star
-import Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic
+import Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Star.Rat  -- wasm64 port: Mathlib v4.35.0 keeps Mathlib.Data.Rat.Star only as a deprecated shim for this module
+import Mathlib.Basic.Real.Basic  -- wasm64 port: Mathlib v4.34.0 keeps Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic only as a deprecated shim for this module
 import Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Trace
-- 
2.50.1

